  #line-at(72pt, 406.58pt, "Multiphysics (COMSOL Inc., Natick, Massachusetts, USA) with ideally repeated units in the lateral directions ")
  #line-at(72pt, 419.8pt, "perpendicular to the flow direction as shown in Figure 1(a). The geometry of the heat transfer surface area (cf. Figure ")
  #line-at(72pt, 433.06pt, "1(b)) was defined analytically as a second-order harmonic function given as ")
