  #line-at(72pt, 301.28pt, "structure in the laminar flow regime (i.e. ")
  #set text(font: "Cambria Math", size: 10.02pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(236.72pt, 301.28pt, "𝑅𝑒≤2000")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.02pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(283.46pt, 301.28pt, ") and vice versa in the turbulent regime.  ")
  #line-at(72pt, 322.7pt, "In summary, the suitability of a particular HX design would depend on its specific application and the desired operating ")
  #line-at(72pt, 335.96pt, "conditions. The structure could be designed either for high heat transfer efficiency with significant pumping ")
  #line-at(72pt, 349.16pt, "requirement or for moderate heat transfer efficiency with low pumping requirement. Likewise, the structure could be ")
  #line-at(72pt, 362.36pt, "designed to possess superior performance in the laminar flow regime or in the turbulent flow regime. Irrespective of ")
  #line-at(72pt, 375.62pt, "the design requirements, the desired performance could be achieved via additively manufacturing of fit-for-purpose ")
  #line-at(72pt, 388.82pt, "complex structures with engineered surface topology.  ")
